- `docs/architecture/templates.md` §"The `:templates` view": the activity column (two targets,
  kinds per target, `RowQuery.Extra`), the footer detail, the failure sentence (H6), the display
  names (H4), forget on delete (H7), the picker (H8), Q1's Synced behaviour; §"Scanning a template"
  and §"The cache and `F`": the dot and `⊗`.
- `docs/architecture/ui-components.md` (where `RowQuery` is described): `RowQuery.Extra` /
